e everywhere, the only way to get results is by engaging […] not by shouting,” said Infantino. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nAt one point, the FIFA president challenged the room of journalists, stressing FIFA will protect the legacy for migrant workers that it set out with the Qatar authorities. <br />\r\n <br />\r\n“I’ll be back, we’ll be here to check, don’t worry, because you will be gone,” he said. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nSo, a year on from the World Cup final, what is the legacy of the 2022 World Cup?</td>\r\n                            </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                    </body>\r\n                    </html>','2025-01-14',1),(292,'Quote request','HAMID KENNOU','hkennou.212@gmail.com','+2120543939752','<html>\r\n    					<body>\r\n        					<h1 style=\"font-weight:normal\">Quote request</h1>\r\n        					<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\">\r\n            					<tr width=\"30%\">\r\n            						<td><strong>First name : </strong></td><td>HAMID</td>\r\n            					</tr>\r\n            					<tr>\r\n            						<td><strong>Last name : </strong></td><td>KENNOU</td>\r\n            					</tr>\r\n            					<tr>\r\n            						<td><strong>Email : </strong></td><td>hkennou.212@gmail.com</td>\r\n            					</tr>\r\n            					<tr>\r\n            						<td><strong>Phone : </strong></td><td>+2120543939752</td>\r\n            					</tr>\r\n            					<tr>\r\n            						<td><strong>Budget : </strong></td><td>138500$</td>\r\n            					</tr>\r\n            					<tr>\r\n            						<td><strong>Services requested : </strong></td><td> - Conception Design Graphique - Marque et de Stratégie</td>\r\n            					</tr>\r\n        					</table>\r\n    					</body>\r\n					</html>','2025-01-14',1),(293,'Quote request','HAMID KENNOU','hkennou.212@gmail.com','+2120543939752','<html>\r\n    					<body>\r\n        					<h1 style=\"font-weight:normal\">Quote request</h1>\r\n        					<table b