ctive!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThat’s why we created our new SMS Text With Lead feature… because once you’ve collected the visitor’s phone number, you can automatically start a text message conversation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nConsider the opportunities – even if you don’t close a deal right away, you can stay connected with text messages for new offers, content links, or even just a quick “how are you doing?” note to establish a relationship.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWouldn’t that be helpful?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGo to https://actionleadgeneration.com to find out what Web Visitors Into Leads can offer for your business.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou could be converting up to 100X more leads today!  <br />\r\nEric<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPS: Web Visitors Into Leads provides a complimentary 14-day trial – and it even includes International calling.  <br />\r\nYou have customers waiting to talk with you right now… don’t leave them waiting.  <br />\r\nGo to https://actionleadgeneration.com to try Web Visitors Into Leads today.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you\'d like to Want to receive fewer emails, or none whatsoever? Update your email preferences by visiting https://actionleadgeneration.com/unsubscribe.aspx?d=helloworld-agency.com</td>\r\n                            </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                    </body>\r\n                    </html>','2025-03-05',1),(398,'Quote request','sbai badre','sbai@tradis.ma','+212661202551','<html>\r\n    					<body>\r\n        					<h1 style=\"font-weight:normal\">Quote request</h1>\r\n        					<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\">\r\n            					<tr width=\"30%\">\r\n            						<td><strong>First name : </strong></td><td>sbai</td>\r\n            					</tr>\r\n            					<tr>\r\n            						<td><strong>Last name : </strong></td><td>badre</td>\r\n            					</tr>\r\n            					<tr>\r\n            						<td><strong>Email : </strong></td><td>sbai@tradis.ma</td>\r\n            					</tr>\r\n            		