age silencieux vous permet de communiquer votre message plus efficacement et de construire une </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">identit&eacute; visuelle</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> forte et coh&eacute;rente.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1c62a665-7fff-2e93-8a7f-eb9d4db8ad28\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Rouge : Passion, &Eacute;nergie, Urgence.</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Cette couleur attire puissamment l&#39;attention, signalant l&#39;excitation, l&#39;amour ou un besoin d&#39;action imm&eacute;diate