e et renfor&ccedil;ant la confiance des </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">consommateurs</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e3c16107-7fff-ee8b-dfba-7cb1f93413c3\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Essai virtuel de v&ecirc;tements et de maquillage</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> : Imaginez que votre client puisse &quot;porter&quot; virtuellement une nouvelle robe ou &quot;essayer&quot; un rouge &agrave; l&egrave;vres virtuel via l&#39;appareil photo de son smartphone. Des applications comme &quot;Perfect Corp.&quot; et &quot;L&#39;Or&eacute;al Virtual Try-On&quot; r&eacute;volutionnent l&#39;industrie de la beaut&eacute; et de la mode. Au </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric