a position actuelle de votre marque. Il ne s&#39;agit pas d&#39;une d&eacute;cision &agrave; prendre &agrave; la l&eacute;g&egrave;re, mais plut&ocirc;t d&#39;une r&eacute;ponse strat&eacute;gique &agrave; des signaux clairs du march&eacute;.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">D&eacute;salignement avec la client&egrave;le cible</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> : Votre marque a-t-elle &eacute;t&eacute; con&ccedil;ue pour un public qui a &eacute;volu&eacute; ou que vous ne ciblez plus ? Par exemple, une entreprise technologique &eacute;tablie &agrave; </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Casablanca</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> qui se concentrait auparavant sur les grandes entreprises pourrait vouloir s&#39;&eacute;tendre aux startups innovantes de </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Marrakech</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">. Son identit&eacute; visuelle et son message actuels pourraient ne pas r&eacute;sonner avec cette nouvelle audience plus jeune et agile. Un </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">rebranding</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> permettrait de moderniser la perception et de parler directement &agrave; ces nouveaux prospects.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Perception obsol&egrave;te ou n&eacute;gative</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> : Le march&eacute; </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">marocain</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> est de plus en plus connect&eacute; et soucieux de l&#39;image. Si votre marque semble dat&eacute;e, ou si elle est associ&eacute;e &agrave; des pratiques d&eacute;pass&eacute;es ou une image n&eacute;gative (par exemple, suite &agrave; un scandale de service client ou une mauvaise presse), un </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">rebranding</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> est imp&eacute;ratif. Pensez &agrave; une entreprise de services financiers qui souhaite passer d&#39;une image &quot;traditionnelle et rigide&quot; &agrave; &quot;innovante et accessible&quot; pour attirer une client&egrave;le plus jeune et digitalis&eacute;e. Une refonte de l&#39;identit&eacute; visuelle et du ton de voix est alors cruciale.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Concurrence accrue et diff&eacute;renciation insuffisante</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> : Si le march&eacute; est inond&eacute; de concurrents et que votre marque se fond dans la masse, il est temps de se d&eacute;marquer. Le </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">rebranding</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> peut cr&eacute;er une proposition de valeur unique qui vous distingue clairement. Une cha&icirc;ne de restaurants &agrave; </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Rabat</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> pourrait se repositionner de &quot;cuisine internationale&quot; &agrave; &quot;gastronomie marocaine moderne et durable&quot;, en accentuant l&#39;approvisionnement local et l&#39;innovation culinaire. Cela implique une r&eacute;&eacute;valuation de l&#39;exp&eacute;rience client compl&egrave;te.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Fusion, acquisition ou expansion significative</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> : Ces &eacute;v&eacute;nements majeurs dans la vie d&#39;une entreprise n&eacute;cessitent souvent un </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">rebranding</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> pour unifier les entit&eacute;s, refl&eacute;ter une nouvelle taille ou un nouveau champ d&#39;action. Si une entreprise de logistique &agrave; </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Marrakech</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> acquiert une entreprise de technologie de livraison, un </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">rebranding</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> commun pourrait symboliser leur nouvelle synergie et leur offre de services &eacute;largie.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;\">2. Le Processus Pratique : B&acirc;tir une Nouvelle Identit&eacute; de Marque</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Une fois la n&eacute;cessit&eacute; du </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">rebranding</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> &eacute;tablie, l&#39;&eacute;tape suivante consiste &agrave; construire une nouvelle identit&eacute; de marque qui soit &agrave; la fois strat&eacute;gique et percutante. Ce processus exige une expertise combin&eacute;e et une collaboration &eacute;troite avec des sp&eacute;cialistes.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">D&eacute;finition claire des objectifs du rebranding</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> : Avant tout design, d&eacute;terminez ce que vous voulez accomplir. Voulez-vous attirer une nouvelle d&eacute;mographie, am&eacute;liorer la perception de la qualit&eacute;, vous positionner comme un leader de l&#39;innovation, ou simplement moderniser votre image ? Ces objectifs guideront toutes les d&eacute;cisions cr&eacute;atives et strat&eacute;giques.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">D&eacute;veloppement de la nouvelle proposition de valeur et du narratif</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> : Le </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">rebranding</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> n&#39;est pas seulement visuel ; il s&#39;agit de red&eacute;finir l&#39;essence de votre marque. Quelle est la nouvelle promesse de votre marque ? Quelle histoire voulez-vous raconter ? Ce narratif doit &ecirc;tre authentique, m&eacute;morable et capable de r&eacute;sonner &eacute;motionnellement avec votre public cible au </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Maroc</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">, potentiellement en int&eacute;grant des &eacute;l&eacute;ments de l&#39;h&eacute;ritage culturel. Une </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Soci&eacute;t&eacute; d&#39;Identit&eacute; Visuelle &agrave; Marrakech</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> est essentielle pour traduire cette nouvelle histoire en &eacute;l&eacute;ments visuels concrets.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Conception de l&#39;identit&eacute; visuelle et verbale</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> : C&#39;est le c&oelig;ur du </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">rebranding</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">. Cela inclut la cr&eacute;ation d&#39;un nouveau logo (ou sa refonte), la s&eacute;lection d&#39;une palette de couleurs et de typographies, la d&eacute;finition d&#39;un style photographique et d&#39;un ton de voix (langage utilis&eacute; dans les communications). Chaque &eacute;l&eacute;ment doit &ecirc;tre pens&eacute; pour refl&eacute;ter la nouvelle personnalit&eacute; et les objectifs de la marque. Par exemple, l&#39;utilisation de couleurs vives et de formes g&eacute;om&eacute;triques pourrait symboliser l&#39;innovation, tandis que des tons terreux et des formes organiques pourraient &eacute;voquer la durabilit&eacute; ou l&#39;artisanat local. Assurez-vous que cette nouvelle identit&eacute; est adaptable &agrave; toutes les plateformes, du site web aux supports imprim&eacute;s, en passant par les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">r&eacute;seaux sociaux</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a36f130f-7fff-a36e-450f-9334c5c40f46\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">D&eacute;veloppement d&#39;une strat&eacute;gie de lancement</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> : Un </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">rebranding</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> ne doit pas &ecirc;tre un changement silencieux. Planifiez un lancement qui cr&eacute;e de l&#39;excitation et informe votre public. Cela peut inclure une campagne de communication int&eacute;gr&eacute;e, un &eacute;v&eacute;nement de lancement au </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Maroc</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">, des annonces sur les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">r&eacute;seaux sociaux</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alte