ont-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">trafic organique</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">, le </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">temps pass&eacute; sur la page</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">, le </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">taux de rebond</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">, et les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">pages vues par session</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Segmenter vos Donn&eacute;es :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Regarder des moyennes globales est rarement utile. Pour des insights plus profonds, segmentez vos </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">donn&eacute;es</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> par :</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n	<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle;\">\r\n		<li aria-level=\"2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n		<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Source de trafic :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> D&#39;o&ugrave; viennent vos utilisateurs (recherche organique, r&eacute;seaux sociaux, e-mail, publicit&eacute; payante) ? Cela vous aidera &agrave; identifier les canaux les plus performants.</span></span></span></p>\r\n		</li>\r\n		<li aria-level=\"2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n		<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Donn&eacute;es d&eacute;mographiques et g&eacute;ographiques :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Quel &acirc;ge ont vos utilisateurs ? O&ugrave; se trouvent-ils (par exemple, &agrave; Marrakech ou dans d&#39;autres villes du Maroc) ? Ces informations sont cruciales pour la </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">personnalisation de campagne</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n		</li>\r\n		<li aria-level=\"2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n		<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Comportement utilisateur :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Quelles pages visitent-ils ? Sur quels boutons cliquent-ils ? Quel est leur parcours avant une conversion ? L&#39;analyse de ces parcours peut r&eacute;v&eacute;ler des points de friction.</span></span></span></p>\r\n		</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Utilisez les Bons Outils :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Ma&icirc;trisez les outils analytiques &agrave; votre disposition. Google Analytics est indispensable pour le trafic web. Les outils d&#39;analyse des plateformes sociales (Facebook Insights, Instagram Analytics) sont cruciaux pour le contenu social. Les tableaux de bord de votre CRM et de vos plateformes publicitaires (Google Ads, Meta Ads) vous donneront des insights sur les conversions et le ROI. L&#39;int&eacute;gration de ces outils, ou l&#39;utilisation d&#39;une plateforme de Business Intelligence, peut vous offrir une vue unifi&eacute;e.</span></span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;\">2. Transformer les Insights en Actions Marketing Concr&egrave;tes</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Avoir des donn&eacute;es, c&#39;est bien. Les transformer en actions qui g&eacute;n&egrave;rent des r&eacute;sultats, c&#39;est mieux. C&#39;est l&agrave; que le v&eacute;ritable pouvoir de l&#39;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">analyse de donn&eacute;es</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> se r&eacute;v&egrave;le.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Optimisation des Campagnes Publicitaires :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Si vos </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">donn&eacute;es</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> montrent qu&#39;une campagne Facebook Ads pour un public sp&eacute;cifique &agrave; Marrakech g&eacute;n&egrave;re un co&ucirc;t par acquisition (CPA) &eacute;lev&eacute;, mais que les annonces sur Google Search pour les m&ecirc;mes mots-cl&eacute;s sont tr&egrave;s rentables, d&eacute;placez une partie de votre budget. Utilisez les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">donn&eacute;es</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> pour affiner le </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">ciblage</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">, les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">cr&eacute;atives</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> (images/vid&eacute;os), les messages et les heures de diffusion. Les tests A/B sont ici vos meilleurs amis : testez une variable &agrave; la fois (titre, image, appel &agrave; l&#39;action) et laissez les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">donn&eacute;es</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> vous dire ce qui fonctionne le mieux.</span></span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Personnalisation de l&#39;Exp&eacute;rience Client :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">donn&eacute;es analytiques</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> vous r&eacute;v&egrave;lent les pr&eacute;f&eacute;rences et les comportements de vos utilisateurs. Utilisez ces informations pour personnaliser :</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n	<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle;\">\r\n		<li aria-level=\"2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n		<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Le contenu de votre site web :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Afficher des banni&egrave;res ou des produits recommand&eacute;s bas&eacute;s sur l&#39;historique de navigation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n		</li>\r\n		<li aria-level=\"2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n		<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Les campagnes d&#39;e-mailing :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Segmenter vos listes et envoyer des e-mails pertinents (produits abandonn&eacute;s dans le panier, offres bas&eacute;es sur les achats pr&eacute;c&eacute;dents).</span></span></span></p>\r\n		</li>\r\n		<li aria-level=\"2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n		<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Les messages sur les r&eacute;seaux sociaux :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Adapter le ton et les sujets en fonction des segments d&#39;audience les plus engag&eacute;s. Cette personnalisation, appuy&eacute;e par les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">donn&eacute;es</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">, renforce la </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">confiance</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> et augmente les chances de conversion.</span></span></span></p>\r\n		</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;\">\r\n	<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2f4182f5-7fff-f543-cb5d-e2fc0238d858\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Optimisation du Contenu et du SEO :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">donn&eacute;es</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> de recherche (mots-cl&eacute;s utilis&eacute;s par vos clients), d&#39;engagement (temps pass&eacute; sur page, taux de rebond) et de conversion vous indiquent quel contenu r&eacute;sonne le mieux avec votre audience. Si un article de blog g&eacute;n&egrave;re beaucoup de trafic mais peu de conversions, il est peut-&eci