important pour des campagnes qui visent &agrave; r&eacute;sonner avec les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">consommateurs marocains</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">. Elle pourra int&eacute;grer des &eacute;l&eacute;ments de design qui parlent &agrave; l&#39;audience tout en conservant une approche moderne et professionnelle. Par exemple, l&#39;utilisation judicieuse de motifs g&eacute;om&eacute;triques islamiques, de calligraphie &eacute;l&eacute;gante ou de couleurs vives inspir&eacute;es de l&#39;artisanat marocain.</span></span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-52686b56-7fff-67d8-4331-793e77bb548f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">En conclusion, le </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">design graphique</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant