asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"> que l&#39;arabe classique. Votre </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\">strat&eacute;gie</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"> doit tenir compte de la g&eacute;ographie de votre </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\">audience cible</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\">.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7745c95a-7fff-cc0d-ea0d-d5eb25649999\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\">Les R&egrave;gles de Transcription et l&#39;Absence de Voyelles Courtes :</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"> L&#39;arabe s&#39;&eacute;crit de droite &agrave; gauche, et les voyelles courtes ne sont g&eacute;n&eacute;ralement pas &eacute;crites. Cela peut entra&icirc;ner diff&eacute;rentes transcriptions latines pour un m&ecirc;me mot arabe, ce qui impacte la recherche de </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\">hashtags</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\">. De plus, les </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\">hashtags arabes</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"> ne tol&egrave;rent pas les espaces ou les caract&egrave;res sp&eacute;ciaux comme leurs homologues latins. Un mot comme &quot;#Ø³ÙˆÙ‚_Ù…Ø±Ø§ÙƒØ´&quot; (Souk Marrakech) utilisera un underscore pour relier les mots, mais il est crucial de s&#39;assurer que la forme sans underscore est &eacute;galement recherch&eacute;e par les utilisateurs. La plupart du temps, les </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\">hashtags arabes</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-varian