nterop&eacute;rables, autrefois rel&eacute;gu&eacute; &agrave; la science-fiction, est d&eacute;sormais une r&eacute;alit&eacute; tangible et en pleine expansion. Loin d&#39;&ecirc;tre un simple gadget, il repr&eacute;sente une nouvelle fronti&egrave;re pour le commerce, la communication et l&#39;interaction sociale. Pour les marques op&eacute;rant au Maroc, se pencher sur le </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">M&eacute;tavers</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> n&#39;est plus une question de curiosit&eacute;, mais de </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">strat&eacute;gie</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">. Alors que le march&eacute; digital marocain est en pleine maturit&eacute;, les consommateurs, notamment les jeunes g&eacute;n&eacute;rations, sont de plus en plus ouverts aux exp&eacute;riences immersives. Ignorer ces </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">espaces virtuels</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">, c&#39;est risquer de manquer une opportunit&eacute; unique de cr&eacute;er des connexions profondes, de renforcer l&#39;engagement client et d&#39;explorer de nouvelles voies de mon&eacute;tisation. Cet article vous offrira des pistes concr&egrave;tes pour que votre marque puisse tirer parti de ce monde en construction.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;\">1. Comprendre le Potentiel du M&eacute;tavers pour les Marques Marocaines</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Le </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">M&eacute;tavers</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> n&#39;est pas un lieu unique, mais une constellation de plateformes (comme Roblox, Decentraland, The Sandbox, Fortnite) offrant des exp&eacute;riences diverses. Pour une marque marocaine, l&#39;opportunit&eacute; r&eacute;side dans l&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; une nouvelle dimension d&#39;interaction client.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Cr&eacute;er des Exp&eacute;riences de Marque Immersives</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Imaginez une marque de mode marocaine lan&ccedil;ant sa nouvelle collection dans un showroom virtuel o&ugrave; les avatars peuvent essayer les tenues, interagir avec les designers et assister &agrave; un d&eacute;fil&eacute; de mode en 3D. Ou un fabricant de tapis artisanaux de F&egrave;s proposant une visite virtuelle de son atelier, permettant aux clients de voir le processus de fabrication et de personnaliser un tapis en temps r&eacute;el avant de l&#39;acheter. Le </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">M&eacute;tavers</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> permet de d&eacute;passer les limites physiques, offrant des exp&eacute;riences sensorielles et interactives que le web traditionnel ne peut &eacute;galer. Cette immersion renforce l&#39;attachement &agrave; la marque et cr&eacute;e des souvenirs m&eacute;morables.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Engager une Nouvelle G&eacute;n&eacute;ration de Consommateurs</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Les jeunes g&eacute;n&eacute;rations (Gen Z, Gen Alpha) sont natives du num&eacute;rique et sont d&eacute;j&agrave; tr&egrave;s pr&eacute;sentes dans les </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">espaces virtuels</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> de jeux et de socialisation. Elles sont avides d&#39;exp&eacute;riences uniques et d&#39;interactions authentiques. Le </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">M&eacute;tavers</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> offre aux marques une voie directe pour se connecter avec cette audience future d&#39;une mani&egrave;re qui r&eacute;sonne avec leurs codes et leurs attentes. Participer &agrave; des &eacute;v&eacute;nements virtuels, cr&eacute;er des objets num&eacute;riques (NFTs), ou sponsoriser des activit&eacute;s au sein de ces mondes peut transformer la relation client-marque en une exp&eacute;rience collaborative et ludique.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Explorer de Nouveaux Mod&egrave;les de Mon&eacute;tisation</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Au-del&agrave; de la publicit&eacute; traditionnelle, le </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">M&eacute;tavers</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> ouvre des horizons in&eacute;dits pour la mon&eacute;tisation. Les marques peuvent vendre des </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">biens num&eacute;riques</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> (skins pour avatars, accessoires, v&ecirc;tements virtuels), organiser des &eacute;v&eacute;nements payants (concerts virtuels, expositions), ou m&ecirc;me cr&eacute;er des &eacute;conomies virtuelles bas&eacute;es sur des jetons. Une marque marocaine pourrait, par exemple, vendre des babouches virtuelles pour les avatars, ou des &eacute;l&eacute;ments de d&eacute;coration inspir&eacute;s de l&#39;architecture marocaine pour des maisons virtuelles. Ces revenus, bien que non conventionnels, peuvent compl&eacute;ter les mod&egrave;les &eacute;conomiques existants et ouvrir de nouvelles sources de profit.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;\">2. Strat&eacute;gies Pratiques pour Entrer dans le M&eacute;tavers Marocain</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Se lancer dans le </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">M&eacute;tavers</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> n&eacute;cessite une </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">strat&eacute;gie</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> claire et une approche progressive. Il ne s&#39;agit pas de reproduire le r&eacute;el, mais de r&eacute;inventer l&#39;interaction.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">D&eacute;finir Votre Objectif et Votre Plateforme</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Avant de vous pr&eacute;cipiter, d&eacute;terminez ce que vous esp&eacute;rez accomplir : notori&eacute;t&eacute;, engagement, vente de biens virtuels, innovation ? Ensuite, choisissez la ou les plateformes les plus pertinentes pour votre marque et votre audience. Si votre cible est tr&egrave;s jeune, Roblox ou Fortnite pourrait &ecirc;tre plus appropri&eacute;. Si vous visez une audience plus technophile et orient&eacute;e vers la crypto, Decentraland ou The Sandbox pourrait &ecirc;tre un meilleur choix. Une </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">agence de strat&eacute;gie de marque &agrave; Marrakech</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> pourra vous aider &agrave; identifier ces opportunit&eacute;s.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Commencer Petit et It&eacute;rer</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Il n&#39;est pas n&eacute;cessaire d&#39;investir des millions d&egrave;s le d&eacute;part. Commencez par des initiatives plus modestes :</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Cr&eacute;er un NFT</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> de marque li&eacute; &agrave; un produit physique ou &agrave; une &oelig;uvre d&#39;art marocaine.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Organiser un &eacute;v&eacute;nement virtuel</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> unique (un DJ set dans un espace inspir&eacute; de Jemaa el-Fna, une galerie d&#39;art num&eacute;rique).</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">D&eacute;velopper des biens num&eacute;riques</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> simples pour des jeux ou des plateformes existantes (par exemple, un avatar portant un caftan marocain stylis&eacute;).</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Ces premi&egrave;res exp&eacute;riences vous permettront de comprendre les dynamiques du </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">M&eacute;tavers</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">, de tester l&#39;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t de votre audience et d&#39;affiner votre </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">strat&eacute;gie</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> avant des investissements plus cons&eacute;quents.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Collaborer avec des Cr&eacute;ateurs Locaux et des Experts</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7b86e31e-7fff-e6b9-ce4d-ae0d9e13e2f9\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Le </span></span></span><span style=\"font-w