-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">prospects inactifs</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">. Ces contacts qui n&#39;ont pas interagi avec votre marque depuis un certain temps ne sont pas perdus pour toujours. Ils repr&eacute;sentent une mine d&#39;or sous-exploit&eacute;e : ils connaissent d&eacute;j&agrave; votre marque, ont montr&eacute; un int&eacute;r&ecirc;t initial, et sont donc plus faciles &agrave; convertir que des prospects totalement froids. Relancer ces </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">prospects inactifs</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> n&#39;est pas seulement une question de volume, c&#39;est une strat&eacute;gie d&#39;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">efficacit&eacute; marketing</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> qui optimise votre </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">retour sur investissement (ROI)</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">. Il s&#39;agit de les r&eacute;engager avec pertinence et valeur, en adaptant votre approche aux sp&eacute;cificit&eacute;s du march&eacute; marocain.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;\">1. Identifier et Segmenter les Prospects Inactifs</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">La premi&egrave;re &eacute;tape cruciale est de comprendre qui sont vos </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">prospects inactifs</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> et pourquoi ils le sont devenus. Une approche &quot;taille unique&quot; ne fonctionnera pas.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">D&eacute;finir l&#39;Inactivit&eacute;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Qu&#39;est-ce qu&#39;un </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">prospect inactif</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> pour votre entreprise au Maroc ? La d&eacute;finition varie selon votre cycle de vente et votre secteur d&#39;activit&eacute;.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Absence d&#39;interactions :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Pas d&#39;ouverture d&#39;e-mails, pas de clics sur les liens, pas de visites sur le site web, pas de r&eacute;ponses &agrave; des appels depuis un certain temps (par exemple, 60, 90 ou 180 jours).</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Absence de conversion :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Ils ont rempli un formulaire ou t&eacute;l&eacute;charg&eacute; un contenu, mais n&#39;ont pas progress&eacute; dans l&#39;entonnoir de vente.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Crit&egrave;res sectoriels :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Pour un concessionnaire automobile &agrave; Casablanca, l&#39;inactivit&eacute; pourrait &ecirc;tre une absence de visite en showroom apr&egrave;s un test drive. Pour une agence de voyage &agrave; Marrakech, l&#39;absence de r&eacute;ponse apr&egrave;s un devis.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Segmenter les Inactifs pour une Approche Cibl&eacute;e</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Une fois identifi&eacute;s, segmentez vos </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">prospects inactifs</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> en fonction de crit&egrave;res qui vous aideront &agrave; personnaliser votre message :</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Niveau d&#39;engagement initial :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Ont-ils juste t&eacute;l&eacute;charg&eacute; un livre blanc, ou sont-ils all&eacute;s jusqu&#39;&agrave; un panier abandonn&eacute; ? Un prospect ayant un panier abandonn&eacute; est potentiellement plus facile &agrave; r&eacute;activer qu&#39;un simple abonn&eacute; &agrave; la newsletter.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Source d&#39;acquisition :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> D&#39;o&ugrave; venaient-ils ? (Campagne sp&eacute;cifique, r&eacute;seau social, site web). Cela peut donner des indices sur leurs int&eacute;r&ecirc;ts initiaux.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Historique de communication :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Quels messages leur avez-vous d&eacute;j&agrave; envoy&eacute;s ? Y a-t-il eu une s&eacute;rie d&#39;e-mails sans r&eacute;ponse ?</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Temps &eacute;coul&eacute; depuis la derni&egrave;re interaction :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Les messages pour quelqu&#39;un inactif depuis 3 mois seront diff&eacute;rents de ceux pour quelqu&#39;un inactif depuis un an.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Profil d&eacute;mographique/g&eacute;ographique :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Sont-ils bas&eacute;s &agrave; Rabat, F&egrave;s, ou dans une autre ville du Maroc ? Quel est leur secteur d&#39;activit&eacute; ?</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Outils Cl&eacute;s :</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Un </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">CRM (Customer Relationship Management)</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> robuste est indispensable pour suivre l&#39;historique de vos prospects et les segmenter efficacement. Des plateformes d&#39;automatisation marketing (comme HubSpot, Salesforce Marketing Cloud) peuvent &eacute;galement vous aider &agrave; d&eacute;finir des r&egrave;gles d&#39;inactivit&eacute; et &agrave; d&eacute;clencher des actions sp&eacute;cifiques.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;\">2. Strat&eacute;gies de Contenu et Canaux de R&eacute;activation</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Une fois vos segments d&#39;inactifs d&eacute;finis, il est temps de choisir le bon message et le bon canal pour les r&eacute;engager. L&#39;objectif est de leur apporter une nouvelle valeur, pas de les spammer.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Proposer une Nouvelle Valeur (Content Marketing)</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Ne vous contentez pas de dire &quot;Revenez&quot;. Offrez une bonne raison :</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Contenu exclusif ou mis &agrave; jour :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Un nouveau livre blanc, une &eacute;tude de cas, un webinaire sur les tendances du march&eacute; marocain.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Offre sp&eacute;ciale et limit&eacute;e :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Une r&eacute;duction unique, un essai gratuit prolong&eacute;, un acc&egrave;s anticip&eacute; &agrave; un nouveau produit ou service. Utilisez des phrases comme &quot;Une offre rien que pour vous...&quot;</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Mise en avant de fonctionnalit&eacute;s/produits oubli&eacute;s :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Rappelez-leur la valeur de votre offre ou mettez en lumi&egrave;re une fonctionnalit&eacute; qui pourrait r&eacute;soudre un probl&egrave;me qu&#39;ils ont.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">T&eacute;moignages de clients satisfaits :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Des histoires de r&eacute;ussite de clients similaires peuvent les inciter &agrave; se r&eacute;engager.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Une simple &quot;prise de nouvelles&quot; :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Un e-mail ou un appel personnel pour savoir s&#39;ils ont trouv&eacute; ce qu&#39;ils cherchaient ou si vous pouvez les aider d&#39;une autre mani&egrave;re.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Choisir les Bons Canaux de Communication</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Adaptez le canal au segment et au message :</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">E-mail Marketing :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> C&#39;est le canal le plus courant. Cr&eacute;ez des campagnes de </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">&quot;re-engagement&quot;</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> avec des objets accrocheurs et un contenu personnalis&eacute;. Une s&eacute;rie de 2 &agrave; 3 e-mails &eacute;tal&eacute;s sur plusieurs semaines est souvent efficace. Le premier peut &ecirc;tre une simple relance, le deuxi&egrave;me une offre de valeur, et le troisi&egrave;me une derni&egrave;re tentative avant de les d&eacute;placer vers une liste d&#39;inactifs profonds.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Appels T&eacute;l&eacute;phoniques Cibl&eacute;s :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Pour les prospects &agrave; haute valeur ajout&eacute;e ou ceux qui &eacute;taient proches de la conversion, un appel personnel peut faire la diff&eacute;rence. Le but n&#39;est pas de vendre agressivement, mais d&#39;offrir de l&#39;aide ou de comprendre ce qui a frein&eacute; leur d&eacute;cision. Votre </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">agence d&#39;acquisition de prospects au Maroc</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> peut former vos &eacute;quipes &agrave; cette approche.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Publicit&eacute; Cibl&eacute;e (Retargeting) :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Diffusez des publicit&eacute;s personnalis&eacute;es sur les </span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">r&eacute;seaux sociaux</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> (Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn) ou des sites web via le retargeting. Montrez-leur des offres qu&#39;ils ont vues mais n&#39;ont pas concr&eacute;tis&eacute;es, ou de nouveaux produits bas&eacute;s sur leurs int&eacute;r&ecirc;ts pass&eacute;s. C&#39;est particuli&egrave;rement efficace pour les paniers abandonn&eacute;s.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">SMS Marketing :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Pour des messages tr&egrave;s courts et urgents (une offre flash, un rappel de rendez-vous), le SMS peut &ecirc;tre pertinent, mais utilisez-le avec parcimonie pour ne pas &ecirc;tre intrusif.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;\">3. Mesurer l&#39;Efficacit&eacute; et Adapter l&#39;Approche</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">La relance des </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">prospects inactifs</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> doit &ecirc;tre un processus it&eacute;ratif, constamment mesur&eacute; et ajust&eacute; pour maximiser les r&eacute;sultats.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Suivre les M&eacute;triques Cl&eacute;s de R&eacute;activation</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Ne vous contentez pas d&#39;envoyer des messages ; suivez leur impact :</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Taux d&#39;ouverture et de clic des e-mails de r&eacute;activation :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Indiquent si votre objet et votre contenu sont assez attrayants.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Taux de conversion :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Combien de prospects r&eacute;activ&eacute;s ont finalement r&eacute;alis&eacute; l&#39;action souhait&eacute;e (achat, inscription, demande de d&eacute;mo) ? C&#39;est le KPI le plus important.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Co&ucirc;t par r&eacute;activation :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Comparez le co&ucirc;t de votre campagne de r&eacute;activation avec la valeur des conversions obtenues. C&#39;est souvent plus bas que le co&ucirc;t d&#39;acquisition d&#39;un nouveau prospect.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Engagement post-r&eacute;activation :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Une fois r&eacute;activ&eacute;s, continuent-ils &agrave; interagir avec votre marque ? Cela prouve une r&eacute;activation durable.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Tester, Apprendre et Optimiser (A/B Testing)</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Les pr&eacute;f&eacute;rences des consommateurs marocains peuvent varier. Testez diff&eacute;rentes approches :</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Objets d&#39;e-mails :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Personnalis&eacute;s vs. directs, avec ou sans emoji.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Contenu des messages :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Ax&eacute; sur une offre, un contenu &eacute;ducatif, ou une approche plus personnelle.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Fr&eacute;quence des relances :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Tous les combien de jours ou semaines envoyer les messages ?</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Canaux :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Quels canaux (e-mail, SMS, appel, retargeting) fonctionnent le mieux pour quels segments ?</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Appels &agrave; l&#39;action (CTA) :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Variez les CTA pour voir lesquels g&eacute;n&egrave;rent le plus de clics.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Savoir Quand Abandonner (ou Changer d&#39;Approche)</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Tous les </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">prospects inactifs</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> ne pourront pas &ecirc;tre r&eacute;activ&eacute;s. Il est important de savoir quand arr&ecirc;ter d&#39;investir du temps et des ressources sur certains contacts :</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Apr&egrave;s une s&eacute;rie de relances infructueuses (par exemple, 3 &agrave; 5 tentatives sans aucune interaction), il est pr&eacute;f&eacute;rable de les retirer de vos listes de communication principales pour ne pas nuire &agrave; votre r&eacute;putation d&#39;exp&eacute;diteur.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Ces prospects peuvent &ecirc;tre mis dans une &quot;liste d&#39;inactifs profonds&quot; pour des tentatives de r&eacute;activation tr&egrave;s occasionnelles (une fois par an avec une offre exceptionnelle, par exemple), ou &ecirc;tre compl&egrave;tement supprim&eacute;s pour nettoyer votre base de donn&eacute;es.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71cf471c-7fff-68b0-d18f-9e437485ecd2\"><span sty