ariant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">strat&eacute;gie marketing &agrave; Marrakech</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> devra tenir compte des sp&eacute;cificit&eacute;s locales.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-22180d54-7fff-a41c-987e-f522ad82373e\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;\">3. Engager et Fid&eacute;liser : B&acirc;tir une Communaut&eacute; Solide</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-22180d54-7fff-a41c-987e-f522ad82373e\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Une </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">marque durable</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> est ancr&eacute;e dans une </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">communaut&eacute;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> de clients fid&egrave;les et engag&eacute;s qui la soutiennent m&ecirc;me en p&eacute;riode difficile.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-22180d54-7fff-a41c-987e-f522ad82373e\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Cultiver l&#39;Engagement sur les Canaux Digitaux</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-22180d54-7fff-a41c-987e-f522ad82373e\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Les </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">r&eacute;seaux sociaux</span></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> sont des outils puissants pour maintenir le lien.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-22180d54-7fff-a41c-987e-f522ad82373e\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Contenu de valeur :</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> Proposez du contenu qui informe, &eacute;duque ou divertit, au-del&agrave; de la simple promotion de vos produits. Des webinaires, des tutoriels, des conseils pratiques peuvent renforcer votre position d&#39;expert et de partenaire.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li r