ji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Strat&eacute;gies gouvernementales de digitalisation (Maroc Digital 2020-2030, etc.)</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e55d3b05-7fff-f5f2-01f9-782aad6231c2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Talents tech disponibles &agrave; Casa &amp; &eacute;mergence d&rsquo;initiatives locales</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e55d3b05-7fff-f5f2-01f9-782aad6231c2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;text-wrap-mode:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Demande croissante pour des services mobiles dans la sant&eacute;, l&rsquo;&eacute;ducation, le transport, l&rsquo;agriculture, etc.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e55d3b05-7fff-f5f2-01f9-782aad6231c2\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-a