 Un emplacement strat&eacute;gique et des fondations solides</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7f7ab797-7fff-a78a-b3b4-a85cfba56ce5\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Casablanca b&eacute;n&eacute;ficie d&rsquo;un emplacement g&eacute;ographique id&eacute;al : fa&ccedil;ade atlantique, proximit&eacute; de l&rsquo;Europe, bons r&eacute;seaux de transport. Plus encore, la ville a progressivement d&eacute;velopp&eacute; une offre digitale robuste : parcs technologiques, zones d&rsquo;affaires, connectivit&eacute;. Par exemple, le projet &laquo; Casablanca Tech Valley &raquo; vise &agrave; transformer la ville en cluster technologique majeur.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7f7ab797-7fff-a78a-b3b4-a85cfba56ce5\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Pour un </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.helloworld-agency.com/service/consulting-en-marketing-digital/\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space-collapse:preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">consultant marketing Marrakech</span></span></span></em></a><span styl