INSERT INTO `hw_temoignages` VALUES (1,NULL,NULL,'rania_pic.jpg',0,1,'CAESA MENA Student agency  helped me apply to a theatre and drama course in Cambridge. It was an incredible introduction to the world of theatre and greatly helped me improve my dancing and acting abilities. I am now envisaging pursuing a career in this field. Thank you to the entire team and CAESA MENA to have made my summer unforgettable!','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency !','Rania  T (Student Testimonial)','2019-11-12','2019-11-20'),(2,NULL,NULL,'louai_.jpg',2,1,'Thanks to CAESA MENA Student Agency, I was made an offer with scholarship to study a Foundation in Engineering ! Studying the foundation was a great preparation and thanks to all which I have learned, I was made an offer from Southampton University and the University of Surrey. I cannot thank enough the guidance and help of Miss Benslimane! ','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency !','Louai S (Student Testimonial)','2019-11-14','2019-11-20'),(3,NULL,NULL,'aymane_bourhfir_champion.jpg',3,1,'The CAESA MENA Student Agency provided expert guidance during  my senior year in high school. Thanks to their support and advice, I was able to obtain an offer to study Business Management at the University of Bath. I would highly recommend the CAESA MENA team to any student looking to apply to a prestigious UK University ! ','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency !','Aymane B (Student Testimonial)','2019-11-14','2019-11-20'),(4,NULL,NULL,'hamza_farid_.jpg',4,1,'Thanks to the CAESA MENA Team, I obtained an offer to study an MSc Global Financial Trading at Coventry University London Campus. At first, I struggled to believe that I could be accepted to a reputable UK University. The CAESA MENA Student agency was support from start to finish. I was lucky enough to settle down really quickly thanks to their meticulous support!  Go CAESA MENA ! ','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency !','Hamza F (Student Testimonial)','2019-11-14','2019-11-20'),(5,NULL,NULL,'cdc40e67-ba51-4d4c-8a6d-342413603f56.jpg',NULL,1,'CAESA MENA Student agency enrolled my daughter to a Junior Medicine Summer programme in Canterbury.  The CAESA MENA team helped us with all the logistic support including applying for my daughter\'s student visa. The summer programme was an eye-opener into the UK system. The experience was an excellent academic booster for my daughter. I am definitely returning to CAESA MENA for her summer programme this summer! ','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency !','Ruoxian B (Parent Testimonial)','2019-11-20','2019-11-20'),(6,NULL,NULL,'nadia_bazgarra.jpg',NULL,1,'Thanks to CAESA MENA I underwent a Summer Medicine course in the United Kingdom. I was able to meet students from all over the world, be taught by expert teachers and improve both my scientific vocabulary in English and my academic English skills. I recommend the CAESA MENA Student Agency to any student looking to study abroad during their summer ! ','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency !','Nadia B (Student Testimonial)','2019-11-20','2019-11-20'),(7,NULL,NULL,'profile_picture_mr.karoum.jpg',3,1,'CAESA MENA Student Agency helped my daughter enroll in a Pharmacy programme in Cambridge this September. All the logistic support was provided quickly and efficiently which allowed our beloved daughter to settle in and begin her studies in the best conditions possible! My wife and I are very proud of the efforts the team have made for us as a family. Thank you once again ! ','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency !','Mr Karoum (Parent Testimonial)','2019-11-21','2019-11-21'),(8,NULL,NULL,'capture_d\'écran_2019-11-23_à _10.49.49.jpg',NULL,1,'CAESA MENA Student Agency helped me since 2015. I started off by enrolling in their 1-2-1General English course followed by an intensive IELTS preparation course that lasted 6 months. Thanks to my improved level of English I was able to enrol in a Foundation to study Business at Coventry University London Campus. Thank you CAESA MENA for your persistent undivided attention and support! ','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency !','Yasser H (Student Testimonial)','2019-11-23','2019-11-23'),(9,NULL,NULL,'capture_d\'écran_2019-12-19_à _17.38.47.jpg',NULL,1,'I still remember my first visit to CAESA MENA Student Agency - I was happy with the dedication of the counselor, Zineb, who took the time to advise me on the best academic route to take leading me to where I am now - a graduate student of one of the best (tripale accredited) business schools in the world - the University of Leeds. I can\'t thank the CAESA MENA Student Agency team enough for having believed in me and supported my application to the University of Leeds! Thank you a million ! ','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency ','Miss Hajar N (Student Testimonial)','2019-12-19','2019-12-19'),(10,8,0,'capture_d\'écran_2019-12-20_à _15.20.18.jpg',NULL,1,'The CAESA MENA Student Agency team are an excellent asset when it comes to helping prepare either the start of your new journey with your Studies ( BBA or MBA) or simply with your UK visa applications.  The managing director is highly dedicated to her work, makes all  her time available to each one of her clients offering them a perfect guidance. I highly recommend her services, she is extremely passionate and that makes you want to use her for any service that you would require in UK or in US. ','Thank you CAESA MENA Student Agency ','Miss Keltoum B.','2019-12-20','2020-02-03');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `hw_temoignages` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

